  "keyFeatures": [
    "Cron, interval, calendar-interval, and one-off date scheduling triggers",
    "Combining triggers (AndTrigger / OrTrigger) for complex schedules",
    "Both synchronous (Scheduler) and asynchronous (AsyncScheduler / AnyIO) APIs",
    "Persistent data stores: PostgreSQL, MySQL, SQLite (via SQLAlchemy), MongoDB",
    "Distributed event brokers: Redis, MQTT, asyncpg / psycopg (PostgreSQL)",
    "Multiple job executors: async, thread pool, process pool, subprocess, Qt",
    "Horizontal scaling and high availability via shared data stores",
    "Coalesce policies and misfire grace time for missed-job handling",
    "Event subscription system for monitoring scheduler lifecycle and job events",
    "Pluggable serializers: pickle, JSON, CBOR"
  ],
